        "description": "Open Blog is a stylish, modern, and lightweight WordPress theme created for bloggers and content creators. Ideal for fashion, lifestyle, travel, food, and photography websites, it offers a clean design and optimized performance for a seamless browsing experience. Fully responsive and mobile-friendly, it works smoothly across all screen sizes and devices. With cross-browser compatibility, accessibility-ready features, and translation support, Open Blog makes it easy to build a professional, engaging, and globally accessible website. Live Preview: https://demo.artifythemes.com/open-blog/"
